# Terraform
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform.lock.hcl
terraform.tfstate
terraform.tfstate.backup
# Real values (subscription/tenant IDs, resource names) live only in the
# local, untracked terraform.tfvars -- terraform.tfvars.example is the
# tracked, placeholder-only template a new deployer copies from.
terraform.tfvars
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
*.tfvars.json
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
# Saved plan files from `terraform plan -out=...` -- binary, ephemeral,
# environment/state-specific (can also embed resolved values), never
# meant to be committed.
*.tfplan
tfplan*.out

